 * 
 * @section streaming_class_diag_summary Summary
 * 
 * Streaming class diagram shows class inheritance hierarchy, dependencies and associations of each unique streaming class.
 * 
 * Each unique streaming class object is created from the universal SDR device control interface - ``SDRDevice`` with the base
 * streaming interface class ``RFStream``.
 * 
 * The ``RFStream`` class is an interface class that declares all possible base streaming functions. Each unique
 * streaming class is derived from the base class and subsequnetly overrides the base functions with custom 
 * function implementations.
 * 
 * Each unique streaming class is dependent on multiple control and data stream interfaces:
 * 
 * - ``IDMA`` - virtual DMA (Direct Memory Access controller) interface class.
 * - ``FPGA`` - virtual FPGA interface class.
 * - ``LMS7002M`` - LMS7002M RFIC interface class. 
 * 
 * The virtual DMA interface declares the base access functions for DMA. Specific DMA interface implementation
 * depends from the device that created the streaming object.
 * 
 * LMS7002M interface class defines the LMS7002M RFIC control functions used to control and configure SDR stream related parameters.
 * 
 * Virtual FPGA interface declares common FPGA control functions used to control and configure SDR stream related parameters.
 * The final implementation of FPGA streaming interface depends on SDR device type, that created the streaming object.
 * Some devices can override the common FPGA control functions with specific implementations.
 * 
 * Both the LMS7002M and FPGA interfaces depend on the ``ISerialPort`` interface, which declares the base functions for
 * communicating with the actual device hardware. ``ISerialPort`` is virtual interface and implementation of declared base
 * functions depends on registerd device type.
 * 
 * @subsection streaming_class_diag_legend Diagram legend
 * 
 * Link definitions:
 * 
 * - Solid line with a transparet arrow head body - Inheritance
 * - Dotted line with simple arrow head - Dependency
 * - Solid line with simeple arrow head - Association
 * 
 */